{"summary":"龙涎石是《本草纲目》记载的矿石类药材，别名龙仙石，产于齐州。主治大风疠疮（严重皮肤病），具有祛风攻毒的功效。","sections":[{"kind":"names","title":"释名","original":"（《纲目》）\n\n时珍曰︰主大风疠疮。出齐州。一名龙仙石。","translation":"主治大风疠疮。出产于齐州。又名龙仙石。"},{"kind":"form","title":"集解","original":""},{"kind":"preparation","title":"修治","original":""},{"kind":"properties","title":"气味","original":""},{"kind":"uses","title":"主治","original":""},{"kind":"commentary","title":"发明","original":""},{"kind":"prescriptions","title":"附方","original":""}],"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%9C%AC%E8%8D%89%E7%B6%B1%E7%9B%AE%2F%E9%87%91%E7%9F%B3%E4%B9%8B%E4%BA%94#龍涎石","retrievedAt":"2026-07-05T14:00:57.612Z"}